# Play engine

- `stage.js`: renderer, themes (`SD.setTheme`), card separation, link-label collision search
- `dsl.js`: authoring helpers only; keep API stable for lessons
- `icons.js`: Lucide-style path map; add glyphs here before using new `glyph` / tag icons
- Theme tokens live in `play/styles.css` under `html[data-theme="dark|light"]`; keep parity with `assets/theme.js` key `sd-theme`

## Safe changes

- Prefer fixing layout in the engine (label side search, card nudge) when many lessons share a failure mode
- Do not break `SD.lesson` registration or packet legend swatches without updating `play/app.js`
- Overlap scanner: `play/tools/scan-layout.mjs` needs local static server + Chrome
